TeCoLab stands for Temperature Control Laboratory. It is an open source platform that contains (Arduino Nano compatible) hardware, firmware (Arduino Nano) and software (Python). The purpose of this project is to provide a cheap platform to help any interested person to understand several basic concepts about control systems. This project uses a MIT License, which means that you are basically free to do anything you like with this project.

All documentation has been moved to the (Wiki)[https://github.com/ytcsc/TeCoLab/wiki]!
